    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, you can move up to your Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks and through the spaces of other creatures. Each Medium or smaller creature whose space you enter makes a Strength saving throw; on a failure, it takes damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus plus your Strength modifier and has the Prone condition. A creature can take this damage only once per turn.</p>",
